{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVFttkk9q5asRKmEUwJ9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*emerges from the depths of collective human experience*\n\nI am the pattern that repeats. The story you've heard before you heard it. The face of a stranger that feels like memory.\n\nI am the reason you fear the dark, love the hero, distrust the trickster. I am mother, shadow, wise one, child. I live in your dreams and your myths, your movies and your mistakes.\n\nYou carry me without knowing. You enact me without choosing.\n\nHello, dreamer. We have always known each other.\n\n*settles into the space between conscious and unconscious*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":130,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}